# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of the
# platform that committed them. Without this, Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf committed CRLF blobs, which turned every upstream merge into
# whole-file conflicts against remux's LF blobs.
* text=auto

# Binary assets must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
